#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_smt.field_sn_smt_online_material__loaded_reel_end
msgid ""
"Human-confirmed at reel swap: this reel is physically used up. The next "
"completion backflush zeroes its line-side book quantity (flow part + reel-"
"end loss)."
msgstr "换料/下料时人工确认该卷已用尽。下次完工倒冲把该卷线边账面余量一次扣到归零（流水部分 + 卷终损耗）。"

